spes: QMI control of mobile data: IPA QMI handshake and WDS session, draft (0212; modem_ipa_data=1 without readonly).

SpesModem.cpp (draft, docs/SPES-QMI-DATA-DRAFT.md) after HackiOS hakios.mpss.c: our IPA QMI server (0x31:0x101: INDICATION_REGISTER,
DRIVER_INIT_COMPLETE, filter install acks) and INIT_DRIVER to the modem's IPA service with spes_ipa_modem_info() (0210), INIT_COMPLETE,
then spes_ipa_modem_start(); data: DPM Open Port (endpoints 1/9), WDA Set Data Format (raw IP, QMAP without checksum), WDS Bind Mux,
Set IP Family v4, Start Network Interface (APN from boot-arg modem_apn, length only logged) once NAS reports registered+PS attached,
Get Runtime Settings -> spes_cell_set_session() (0211); packet service status -> session down. SMP2P "ipa" answer 3 while the IPA
clock is on. Gate: modem_ipa_data=1, modem_ipa_readonly!=1 and spes_ipa_ready(); otherwise no change at all.

